<title>UK: Southern Electric yr pretax profit declines.</title>
<headline>Southern Electric yr pretax profit declines.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) *	     37.5		  vs     43.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)*	15.05		 vs	na</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  21.5		  vs     18.75</p>
<p> Pretax		     255.5		  vs    283.0</p>
<p> Turnover		 1,767.1		  vs  1,717.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax, pre-exceptionals profits in a range between 227 and 275 million stg.</p>
<p>*The EPS and the dividend per share have taken a 2-for-1 share split into account.</p>
<p>Full company name - Southern Electric Plc.</p>
<p>---London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
